WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:02.040
- Isla Kastner, also
known as the Occultist,

00:00:02.040 --> 00:00:04.370
was born in 1932 to Father Kastner,

00:00:04.370 --> 00:00:05.910
a Priest in Brookfield, Connecticut.

00:00:05.910 --> 00:00:07.920
We know this based on
Father Kastner's photo album

00:00:07.920 --> 00:00:09.190
that he shows to Lorraine Warren.

00:00:09.190 --> 00:00:10.720
Not much is known about Isla's mother

00:00:10.720 --> 00:00:12.920
except for the fact that
she died during childbirth.

00:00:12.920 --> 00:00:14.730
This led Father Kastner
to make the decision

00:00:14.730 --> 00:00:16.060
to raise Isla in secrecy,

00:00:16.060 --> 00:00:17.590
in an old mill at the edge of town,

00:00:17.590 --> 00:00:18.870
where the Church wouldn't find her.

00:00:18.870 --> 00:00:20.940
He made this choice
because, understandably,

00:00:20.940 --> 00:00:22.620
the Church would probably
have a lot of questions

00:00:22.620 --> 00:00:25.030
about how a Priest, who
took a vow of celibacy,

00:00:25.030 --> 00:00:26.455
suddenly has a biological child

00:00:26.455 --> 00:00:28.420
and I think claiming immaculate conception

00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:29.760
was probably out of the question.

00:00:29.760 --> 00:00:31.700
Though, I do kind of wonder
why he wouldn't just claim

00:00:31.700 --> 00:00:33.840
that he found the baby
and offer to take her in?

00:00:33.840 --> 00:00:36.410
It's not like paternity
tests were common in 1932.

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:37.671
But maybe it still would
have looked suspicious

00:00:37.671 --> 00:00:39.150
if they looked alike.

00:00:39.150 --> 00:00:40.410
Secret romantic affairs

00:00:40.410 --> 00:00:42.100
were not Father Kastner's only hobby.

00:00:42.100 --> 00:00:43.780
He became obsessed with the occult

00:00:43.780 --> 00:00:45.230
and for much of Isla's childhood,

00:00:45.230 --> 00:00:47.010
she witnessed her Dad studying Satanists

00:00:47.010 --> 00:00:48.693
to try to stop them from
spreading their evil.

00:00:48.693 --> 00:00:50.650
His interest in studying the occult,

00:00:50.650 --> 00:00:52.330
combined with Isla's confinement

00:00:52.330 --> 00:00:54.030
to where those occult objects were kept,

00:00:54.030 --> 00:00:55.640
ended up creating a perfect storm

00:00:55.640 --> 00:00:57.953
that led to Isla becoming
the exact type of Satanist

00:00:57.953 --> 00:00:59.680
that Father Kastner feared.

00:00:59.680 --> 00:01:01.620
To find out how Isla became an occultist

00:01:01.620 --> 00:01:03.620
who dedicated her life to an evil curse,

00:01:03.620 --> 00:01:05.378
stick around to the end of this video.

00:01:05.378 --> 00:01:07.447
This video is sponsored by Audible.

00:01:07.447 --> 00:01:10.530
(intense rock music)

00:01:13.226 --> 00:01:15.090
Welcome to Horror History.

00:01:15.090 --> 00:01:16.730
In this lesson I'll be covering the life,

00:01:16.730 --> 00:01:19.040
atrocities and death of
Brookfield, Connecticut's

00:01:19.040 --> 00:01:21.090
most deadly satanist, Isla Kastner.

00:01:21.090 --> 00:01:23.720
Or, as I sometimes call
her, The Malnourished Lady.

00:01:23.720 --> 00:01:24.780
Before Isla's birth,

00:01:24.780 --> 00:01:26.910
the Church had been using
an old mill by the river

00:01:26.910 --> 00:01:29.100
just outside Brookfield,
Connecticut for storage.

00:01:29.100 --> 00:01:30.217
As Father Kasnter put it,

00:01:30.217 --> 00:01:32.240
"It's where they put the things
that they were afraid of.

00:01:32.240 --> 00:01:33.790
Things they didn't understand."

00:01:33.790 --> 00:01:34.840
Leaning into the metaphor,

00:01:34.840 --> 00:01:36.350
he thought this would be the best place

00:01:36.350 --> 00:01:38.480
to raise his illegitimate
daughter in secret.

00:01:38.480 --> 00:01:39.450
When I say it out loud,

00:01:39.450 --> 00:01:42.180
it kind of makes sense that
Isla turned out the way she did.

00:01:42.180 --> 00:01:44.200
Since Father Kastner
raised Isla in secret,

00:01:44.200 --> 00:01:45.550
it's safe to assume she was homeschooled

00:01:45.550 --> 00:01:47.640
and wouldn't have been
allowed to have any friends.

00:01:47.640 --> 00:01:49.451
Except for maybe her dog Petee?

00:01:49.451 --> 00:01:51.824
Either way, Isla couldn't
have had much socialization

00:01:51.824 --> 00:01:54.430
with other kids, or
anyone, besides her Dad.

00:01:54.430 --> 00:01:55.900
While Father Kastner didn't seem to think

00:01:55.900 --> 00:01:57.002
this was a problem.

00:01:57.002 --> 00:01:58.384
- It was just the two of us.

00:01:58.384 --> 00:02:01.441
Our happiness filled this house.

00:02:01.441 --> 00:02:03.632
- Isla seemed to have a different opinion.

00:02:03.632 --> 00:02:04.465
(Isla growls)

00:02:04.465 --> 00:02:05.667
Having to be hidden away
from the world in shame,

00:02:05.667 --> 00:02:07.716
along with her father's
obsession with satanism,

00:02:07.716 --> 00:02:09.780
made for a deadly
combination as Isla grew up

00:02:09.780 --> 00:02:11.600
with a thirst to get back at the world

00:02:11.600 --> 00:02:12.650
that she had been shunned from.

00:02:12.650 --> 00:02:14.370
In order to understand the deadly curse

00:02:14.370 --> 00:02:15.700
that she dedicated herself to,

00:02:15.700 --> 00:02:18.316
we'll need to take it back
to before she was even born.

00:02:18.316 --> 00:02:20.899
(creepy music)

00:02:22.902 --> 00:02:25.038
When cults are mentioned
in the mainstream lexicon,

00:02:25.038 --> 00:02:27.471
they're usually associated with the 1970s.

00:02:27.471 --> 00:02:29.131
This is because some of the most infamous

00:02:29.131 --> 00:02:30.960
and destructive cults
were brought to light

00:02:30.960 --> 00:02:31.793
during that decade,

00:02:31.793 --> 00:02:33.610
one of the most prominent
being Charles Manson

00:02:33.610 --> 00:02:34.443
and his followers.

00:02:34.443 --> 00:02:35.631
- Do you feel blame?

00:02:35.631 --> 00:02:36.747
Are you mad?

00:02:36.747 --> 00:02:39.101
Do you feel like (gibberish)
wooshka bobfroh renitch?

00:02:39.101 --> 00:02:41.549
Gafrenis booj boojehjeh Peter remitch

00:02:41.549 --> 00:02:43.032
Gidge a gidge gidge gee gee goo goo

00:02:43.032 --> 00:02:46.107
Peegabeegli bethbluth
fido veditch fy eyegoblba?

00:02:46.107 --> 00:02:47.387
- However, cults had
been feared by civilians

00:02:47.387 --> 00:02:49.220
for centuries before this.

00:02:49.220 --> 00:02:51.600
According to Penn State humanities
professor Philip Jenkins,

00:02:51.600 --> 00:02:53.170
there are cults on record that date back

00:02:53.170 --> 00:02:54.499
as far as the late 1800s.

00:02:54.499 --> 00:02:57.127
However, it wasn't until the early 1930s

00:02:57.127 --> 00:02:59.660
when of the earliest recorded
anti-cult movements began.

00:02:59.660 --> 00:03:02.040
As new political and religious
groups started to form,

00:03:02.040 --> 00:03:02.990
there was a backlash,

00:03:02.990 --> 00:03:04.810
and many of these groups were speculated

00:03:04.810 --> 00:03:07.085
to be cults of Satanists
who promoted devil worship.

00:03:07.085 --> 00:03:10.020
The media of the 1920s
really ran with this idea

00:03:10.020 --> 00:03:12.380
and both the Christian and
Catholic sects of the Church

00:03:12.380 --> 00:03:14.670
found these groups to be
particularly threatening.

00:03:14.670 --> 00:03:16.410
So this is where Father Kastner's concern

00:03:16.410 --> 00:03:17.530
about these cults started.

00:03:17.530 --> 00:03:18.860
Even prior to Isla's birth,

00:03:18.860 --> 00:03:20.720
he was likely spending a
lot of time at the mill

00:03:20.720 --> 00:03:22.080
as he studied these groups.

00:03:22.080 --> 00:03:25.180
After Isla's birth in 1932,
she grew up in isolation.

00:03:25.180 --> 00:03:27.300
Instead of doing the things
a kid would normally do,

00:03:27.300 --> 00:03:29.740
like play with other children or eat food,

00:03:29.740 --> 00:03:31.310
Isla explored the tunnels below the mill,

00:03:31.310 --> 00:03:32.860
becoming very familiar with them.

00:03:32.860 --> 00:03:35.270
Meanwhile, at home, her
father's office was littered

00:03:35.270 --> 00:03:36.980
with cursed items from different Satanists

00:03:36.980 --> 00:03:38.280
that the Church had investigated.

00:03:38.280 --> 00:03:40.410
Even if Father Kastner
had tried to keep Isla

00:03:40.410 --> 00:03:42.310
out of his office where
these items resided,

00:03:42.310 --> 00:03:44.870
she inevitably would have still
found her way in to explore,

00:03:44.870 --> 00:03:46.280
just as Judy Warren later did

00:03:46.280 --> 00:03:48.459
at Ed and Lorraine's locked
room of cursed items.

00:03:48.459 --> 00:03:50.568
- Honey, what are you doing?

00:03:50.568 --> 00:03:51.500
Come here.

00:03:51.500 --> 00:03:53.321
You know better.

00:03:53.321 --> 00:03:55.630
- Like Judy, Isla would have been curious

00:03:55.630 --> 00:03:57.250
about what her father was
spending most of his time doing

00:03:57.250 --> 00:04:00.006
and about the unique items
that filled his study.

00:04:00.006 --> 00:04:01.550
The difference is that growing up,

00:04:01.550 --> 00:04:03.150
Judy had three adults to look after her.

00:04:03.150 --> 00:04:04.500
Isla had one.

00:04:04.500 --> 00:04:06.630
Where Judy had other
outlets to be a normal kid,

00:04:06.630 --> 00:04:08.260
like roller skating with her babysitter

00:04:08.260 --> 00:04:09.550
or raising the chickens,

00:04:09.550 --> 00:04:12.026
Isla really only had her
father and his obsessions.

00:04:12.026 --> 00:04:13.499
As Father Kastner would
later state himself-

00:04:13.499 --> 00:04:16.496
- I continued my studies into the occult.

00:04:16.496 --> 00:04:18.883
I wanted to protect her from all of this.

00:04:19.853 --> 00:04:23.110
Instead I created a fascination.

00:04:23.110 --> 00:04:25.796
- As the anti-cult scare of
the 1940s started to die down,

00:04:25.796 --> 00:04:28.228
Isla entered her late
teens and early twenties.

00:04:28.228 --> 00:04:30.260
I would credit Isla's
virtual isolation as a child

00:04:30.260 --> 00:04:32.430
to leading her into a life of rebellion

00:04:32.430 --> 00:04:34.230
and a desire to break
away from her father.

00:04:34.230 --> 00:04:35.970
I mean, plenty of teenagers try to rebel

00:04:35.970 --> 00:04:37.830
against their parents and
form their own identity

00:04:37.830 --> 00:04:40.189
without having been confined
to a secret hidden life.

00:04:40.189 --> 00:04:41.720
But where most young adults leave home

00:04:41.720 --> 00:04:44.070
to form their own identity
by going to college,

00:04:44.070 --> 00:04:45.644
joining the army, dating some lunatic

00:04:45.644 --> 00:04:47.391
their parents don't approve of,

00:04:47.391 --> 00:04:48.813
dying their hair some ugly color,

00:04:48.813 --> 00:04:51.510
getting tattoos, or even
subscribing to CZsWorld,

00:04:51.510 --> 00:04:53.480
Isla took what she had become
the most familiar with,

00:04:53.480 --> 00:04:54.995
the occult, and ran with it.

00:04:54.995 --> 00:04:58.750
Isla's life from 21 to 49 years
old is left mostly unknown.

00:04:58.750 --> 00:05:01.740
Father Kastner implies that
she disappeared, stating-

00:05:01.740 --> 00:05:02.640
- After all these years,

00:05:02.640 --> 00:05:04.730
I hoped she'd come back to me again.

00:05:04.730 --> 00:05:06.047
- In the last documented photo of her,

00:05:06.047 --> 00:05:08.400
she is 20 years old in 1952.

00:05:08.400 --> 00:05:09.630
Because it's the last photo,

00:05:09.630 --> 00:05:11.721
she must have disappeared
around that time.

00:05:11.721 --> 00:05:12.889
Prior to her disappearance,

00:05:12.889 --> 00:05:14.730
Father Kastner describes her fascination

00:05:14.730 --> 00:05:16.740
with the Satanic information
he had been studying,

00:05:16.740 --> 00:05:18.020
so it's likely that she followed

00:05:18.020 --> 00:05:19.820
one of the many occult
groups that she learned of

00:05:19.820 --> 00:05:22.200
through the texts and cursed
items in her Dad's office.

00:05:22.200 --> 00:05:23.340
There are many to choose from,

00:05:23.340 --> 00:05:24.880
so it's tough to say with certainty

00:05:24.880 --> 00:05:26.090
which one she would have chosen.

00:05:26.090 --> 00:05:29.030
However, based on what the
Warrens and Father Kastner learn

00:05:29.030 --> 00:05:30.630
about what Isla had been working on,

00:05:30.630 --> 00:05:33.837
it's possible that she didn't
go very far away at all.

