00:06:32.620 --> 00:06:34.410
Father Kastner studied many cults,

00:06:34.410 --> 00:06:36.500
but the one that occupied
most of his attention

00:06:36.500 --> 00:06:37.890
was The Disciples Of The Ram.

00:06:37.890 --> 00:06:38.780
This is the same cult

00:06:38.780 --> 00:06:40.070
that Annabelle Higgins was part of

00:06:40.070 --> 00:06:42.120
when she and her boyfriend
butchered her adoptive parents

00:06:42.120 --> 00:06:43.350
and attempted to kill the neighbors

00:06:43.350 --> 00:06:45.070
under the control of the demon, Malthus.

00:06:45.070 --> 00:06:46.400
If you want to know more about Malthus,

00:06:46.400 --> 00:06:48.610
check out my Horror
History episode on Malthus,

00:06:48.610 --> 00:06:49.950
which goes into more detail.

00:06:49.950 --> 00:06:51.920
But did Isla join the Disciples of the Ram

00:06:51.920 --> 00:06:53.510
or take influence from them?

00:06:53.510 --> 00:06:55.550
To answer this, we'll need
to look at the timeline.

00:06:55.550 --> 00:06:56.650
From what we see in "Annabelle,"

00:06:56.650 --> 00:06:58.080
where the cult has gained enough notoriety

00:06:58.080 --> 00:07:01.120
to become a concern of the
general public around 1966

00:07:01.120 --> 00:07:03.120
when Annabelle Higgins
left her family and,

00:07:03.120 --> 00:07:04.860
similar to Isla, disappeared.

00:07:04.860 --> 00:07:06.328
Isla left home in 1952,

00:07:06.328 --> 00:07:08.380
so it's unlikely that
she would have joined

00:07:08.380 --> 00:07:09.420
this specific group,

00:07:09.420 --> 00:07:10.740
because Father Kastner probably

00:07:10.740 --> 00:07:13.240
didn't start studying
them until the 1960s.

00:07:13.240 --> 00:07:14.970
Plus, the demon that Isla summons later

00:07:14.970 --> 00:07:17.383
is definitely not Malthus
but we'll get to that.

00:07:17.383 --> 00:07:19.140
Isla really could have
traveled really anywhere

00:07:19.140 --> 00:07:21.510
to investigate any of the
occult items or groups

00:07:21.510 --> 00:07:22.940
that her father was so afraid of,

00:07:22.940 --> 00:07:25.070
but it's also very likely
that she was living

00:07:25.070 --> 00:07:27.700
in the tunnels below the mill
for the last few decades.

00:07:27.700 --> 00:07:29.310
It would at least explain why she looks

00:07:29.310 --> 00:07:30.800
so malnourished and pale.

00:07:30.800 --> 00:07:32.050
Throughout the 1970s,

00:07:32.050 --> 00:07:34.040
assuming she had any access to newspapers,

00:07:34.040 --> 00:07:35.140
radio or television,

00:07:35.140 --> 00:07:37.420
she would have witnessed her
Dad's fears come to fruition

00:07:37.420 --> 00:07:39.450
as some of the most destructive
cults were revealed.

00:07:39.450 --> 00:07:41.737
The Charles Manson
Family was caught in 1969

00:07:41.737 --> 00:07:44.570
and the Jonestown
Massacre occurred in 1978.

00:07:44.570 --> 00:07:46.700
These cults may not have
been Satanist cults,

00:07:46.700 --> 00:07:48.790
at least not directly, but regardless,

00:07:48.790 --> 00:07:51.144
concerned mothers and, perhaps
unintentionally, The Beatles

00:07:51.144 --> 00:07:53.990
amped up a nationwide
panic that Father Kastner

00:07:53.990 --> 00:07:55.640
had dedicated himself to preventing.

00:07:55.640 --> 00:07:58.162
All of this set a scene for the 1980s.

00:07:58.162 --> 00:08:01.674
(upbeat rock music)

00:08:01.674 --> 00:08:02.507
- Get loose!

00:08:02.507 --> 00:08:03.831
You gotta be loose.

00:08:03.831 --> 00:08:05.287
(distorted speech)

00:08:05.287 --> 00:08:09.704
- [Announcer] Finally,
champions on this January day.

00:08:10.722 --> 00:08:11.555
(singing) Seven-Up!

00:08:11.555 --> 00:08:13.810
- To describe this story as horrifying

00:08:13.810 --> 00:08:15.340
would be an understatement.

00:08:15.340 --> 00:08:16.830
- [Announcer] Satanism.

00:08:16.830 --> 00:08:18.010
Devil worship.

00:08:18.010 --> 00:08:20.400
It's being practiced
all around the country.

00:08:20.400 --> 00:08:21.620
- [Announcer] Devil Worship.

00:08:21.620 --> 00:08:23.667
Exposing Satan's underground.

00:08:23.667 --> 00:08:25.083
- To some it's a religion.

00:08:25.083 --> 00:08:25.916
(scary chanting)

00:08:25.916 --> 00:08:29.234
To others, it's the practice
of evil in the devil's name.

00:08:29.234 --> 00:08:31.910
It exists, and it's flourishing.

00:08:31.910 --> 00:08:34.420
- There's another attack upon our society.

00:08:34.420 --> 00:08:36.930
- Yes, there's a vast
movement toward the occult

00:08:36.930 --> 00:08:38.713
within the cartoon and toy industry.

00:08:38.713 --> 00:08:40.550
(Skeletor laughing)

00:08:40.550 --> 00:08:42.230
- Those represent the horns of Baphomet,

00:08:42.230 --> 00:08:43.748
or the horns of Satan.

00:08:43.748 --> 00:08:45.908
- [Announcer] How could this happen here?

00:08:45.908 --> 00:08:47.150
(boy screaming)

00:08:47.150 --> 00:08:49.340
To a nice boy from a good Catholic school

00:08:49.340 --> 00:08:50.850
in a fine middle class family?

00:08:50.850 --> 00:08:52.420
- Is it the Church's position

00:08:52.420 --> 00:08:54.528
that demonic possession is possible?

00:08:54.528 --> 00:08:55.361
- It certainly is.

00:08:55.361 --> 00:08:57.067
- The Satanic Panic of the 1980s

00:08:57.067 --> 00:09:00.219
was basically a repeat of the
anti-cult scare of the 1940s.

00:09:00.219 --> 00:09:02.010
The event that really marks the beginning

00:09:02.010 --> 00:09:04.650
of the Satanic Panic was a book
called "Michelle Remembers"

00:09:04.650 --> 00:09:07.220
which was written by Canadian
Psychologist, Lawrence Pazder

00:09:07.220 --> 00:09:09.080
with his patient, and then later wife,

00:09:09.080 --> 00:09:10.950
two titles that should
probably not go together,

00:09:10.950 --> 00:09:13.360
Michelle Smith, about her
scarring childhood memories

00:09:13.360 --> 00:09:14.500
in a satanist cult.

00:09:14.500 --> 00:09:16.730
While the validity of this
book has since been debated,

00:09:16.730 --> 00:09:19.210
it was widely popular and
sparked a media frenzy,

00:09:19.210 --> 00:09:21.689
fanning fears and sparking
many allegations of Satanism.

00:09:21.689 --> 00:09:24.960
If Isla had any access to the
media at all during this time,

00:09:24.960 --> 00:09:26.950
she would have been exposed
to this moral panic,

00:09:26.950 --> 00:09:28.950
which was directly
associated with the Church.

00:09:28.950 --> 00:09:31.200
Due to her position, Isla
already had it engrained

00:09:31.200 --> 00:09:33.212
to associate the Church
with shame and resentment.

00:09:33.212 --> 00:09:34.797
According to the New York Times,

00:09:34.797 --> 00:09:37.250
"Early in the 1980s,
baseless conspiracy theories

00:09:37.250 --> 00:09:39.030
about cults committing
crimes against children

00:09:39.030 --> 00:09:40.120
spread around the country."

00:09:40.120 --> 00:09:41.550
The way that Father Kastner speaks

00:09:41.550 --> 00:09:42.670
about the Disciples of The Ram

00:09:42.670 --> 00:09:44.130
alludes to this phenomenon.

00:09:44.130 --> 00:09:47.860
- They defiled holy land
with their obscene rituals

00:09:47.860 --> 00:09:51.307
and they committed acts of blasphemy

00:09:52.791 --> 00:09:54.320
of which I shall never speak of.

00:09:54.320 --> 00:09:55.990
- With years of built up resentment

00:09:55.990 --> 00:09:57.780
towards her father and
the world around her,

00:09:57.780 --> 00:09:59.617
this outbreak of alleged Satanic activity

00:09:59.617 --> 00:10:02.600
gave Isla the motivation to
act on her occult findings

00:10:02.600 --> 00:10:03.660
in her late 40s.

00:10:03.660 --> 00:10:05.940
She discovered a curse from
a section of witchcraft

00:10:05.940 --> 00:10:07.280
called the Stregheria.

00:10:07.280 --> 00:10:09.300
The Stregheria is a practice of witchcraft

00:10:09.300 --> 00:10:10.630
originating in northern Italy.

00:10:10.630 --> 00:10:12.130
It was a modernized Paganism

00:10:12.130 --> 00:10:13.567
and most of the incantations or spells

00:10:13.567 --> 00:10:15.780
aimed for a bountiful harvest season,

00:10:15.780 --> 00:10:16.950
or wishing for a loved one

00:10:16.950 --> 00:10:18.420
to return home safely from travel.

00:10:18.420 --> 00:10:21.206
But Isla found a much more
specific and darker curse.

00:10:21.206 --> 00:10:22.960
- [Drew] Now, my Latin is rusty,

00:10:22.960 --> 00:10:27.960
but I think this is talking
about a human sacrifice.

00:10:28.150 --> 00:10:31.295
- [Ed] One by murder and
the other by suicide.

00:10:31.295 --> 00:10:32.790
- Whether Isla really did leave home

00:10:32.790 --> 00:10:34.030
to discover the Stregheria,

00:10:34.030 --> 00:10:36.400
or if it was one of the many
texts in her father's study,

00:10:36.400 --> 00:10:38.200
she figured out how to perform this curse,

00:10:38.200 --> 00:10:40.560
and put it into action in May of 1981,

00:10:40.560 --> 00:10:42.930
just before she was set
to turn 50 years old.

00:10:42.930 --> 00:10:44.500
Isla built a large stone altar

00:10:44.500 --> 00:10:45.680
in the tunnels under the mill.

00:10:45.680 --> 00:10:47.410
Which I have to admit
is really impressive,

00:10:47.410 --> 00:10:48.870
considering that it looks pretty heavy,

00:10:48.870 --> 00:10:51.410
and she probably only weighs
about 40 pounds herself.

00:10:51.410 --> 00:10:53.120
On the altar, she carved a pentagram

00:10:53.120 --> 00:10:54.570
and lined it with black candles.

00:10:54.570 --> 00:10:56.180
Through this curse, Isla could perform

00:10:56.180 --> 00:10:57.210
a ritual at the altar,

00:10:57.210 --> 00:10:59.250
allowing her to take
possession of other people.

00:10:59.250 --> 00:11:00.830
She lights the candles
around the pentagram

00:11:00.830 --> 00:11:01.900
with a chalice in the middle,

00:11:01.900 --> 00:11:04.230
then cracks an egg into
it and lights it on fire

00:11:04.230 --> 00:11:05.360
before drinking from it,

00:11:05.360 --> 00:11:07.770
probably the most protein
she got the entire month.

00:11:07.770 --> 00:11:09.910
The curse requires Isla
to connect to the subject

00:11:09.910 --> 00:11:10.940
that she wants to control

00:11:10.940 --> 00:11:13.170
in order to offer their soul
to the demon she summoned.

00:11:13.170 --> 00:11:15.350
She does this by putting
a physical witch's totem

00:11:15.350 --> 00:11:17.570
in that person's possession
or on their property.

00:11:17.570 --> 00:11:19.820
Isla makes her own totems
out of the jaws of animals

00:11:19.820 --> 00:11:21.120
and other natural materials.

00:11:21.120 --> 00:11:22.550
I'm guessing she got the animal skulls

00:11:22.550 --> 00:11:23.830
from livestock in the area,

00:11:23.830 --> 00:11:26.400
and this may also explain where
she's been getting food from

00:11:26.400 --> 00:11:28.190
and where she gets the
eggs from for her ritual.

00:11:28.190 --> 00:11:30.510
It's not exactly clear how or why Isla

00:11:30.510 --> 00:11:31.960
chooses her specific victims.

00:11:31.960 --> 00:11:34.340
We can only assume she surveyed
the people of Brookfield

00:11:34.340 --> 00:11:36.210
and chose those who fit the profile needed

00:11:36.210 --> 00:11:37.130
for the curse to work.

00:11:37.130 --> 00:11:38.380
We eventually learn that this curse

00:11:38.380 --> 00:11:39.860
requires a human sacrifice,

00:11:39.860 --> 00:11:41.620
one by murder and one by suicide,

00:11:41.620 --> 00:11:43.372
so she targets a pair of
unsuspecting college students,

00:11:43.372 --> 00:11:45.600
Jessica Strong and Katie Lincoln.

00:11:45.600 --> 00:11:47.190
Isla could have hidden the totem somewhere

00:11:47.190 --> 00:11:48.620
in Jessica's dwelling at college

00:11:48.620 --> 00:11:50.940
or she might have tricked her
and given it to her directly.

00:11:50.940 --> 00:11:52.080
Whatever the case may be,

00:11:52.080 --> 00:11:53.560
Jessica must have thought her totem

00:11:53.560 --> 00:11:54.720
was something interesting

00:11:54.720 --> 00:11:56.135
rather than a dangerous witch artifact,

00:11:56.135 --> 00:11:57.470
because she brought it home with her

00:11:57.470 --> 00:11:58.630
to Danvers, Massachusetts,

00:11:58.630 --> 00:12:01.532
unintentionally allowing Isla
to take control over her.

00:12:01.532 --> 00:12:04.532
(logo thuds loudly)

00:12:06.677 --> 00:12:09.260
(creepy music)

00:12:10.360 --> 00:12:12.310
After placing the curse on Jessica Strong,

00:12:12.310 --> 00:12:13.858
Isla was able to see
everything she was doing.

00:12:13.858 --> 00:12:16.500
Late one night, Jessica brings
her friend Katie Lincoln

00:12:16.500 --> 00:12:17.510
to explore the forest,

00:12:17.510 --> 00:12:19.550
and with the two isolated
from any spectators,

00:12:19.550 --> 00:12:20.900
Isla took control of Jessica

00:12:20.900 --> 00:12:22.960
and proceeded to stab Katie to death.

00:12:22.960 --> 00:12:25.130
When Jessica came to and
realized what she had done,

00:12:25.130 --> 00:12:26.710
she ran away in a panic in the dark,

00:12:26.710 --> 00:12:28.071
leading her straight
off the side of a cliff

00:12:28.071 --> 00:12:29.540
where she fell to her death.

00:12:29.540 --> 00:12:32.320
Technically, the murder and
the suicide had been fulfilled.

00:12:32.320 --> 00:12:33.920
The next part of the curse
involved the sacrifices

00:12:33.920 --> 00:12:35.400
of three more people,

00:12:35.400 --> 00:12:37.415
the child, the lover and the Man of God.

00:12:37.415 --> 00:12:39.420
First, she would go after the child

00:12:39.420 --> 00:12:40.980
which brought her to the Glatzel family,

00:12:40.980 --> 00:12:42.814
who had a young son, 8
year old David Glatzel,

00:12:42.814 --> 00:12:45.260
and were in the process
moving into their new home

00:12:45.260 --> 00:12:46.860
in May of 1981.

00:12:46.860 --> 00:12:48.280
Before they even began moving in,

00:12:48.280 --> 00:12:49.750
she placed a totem under the house

00:12:49.750 --> 00:12:51.410
directly below the child's bedroom.

00:12:51.410 --> 00:12:52.785
David started to exhibit strange behavior

00:12:52.785 --> 00:12:54.310
and signs of possession,

00:12:54.310 --> 00:12:56.030
so as we have seen many
times in The Conjurverse,

00:12:56.030 --> 00:12:58.010
the Catholic Church soon got involved

00:12:58.010 --> 00:12:59.594
and the paranormal investigators
Ed and Lorraine Warren

00:12:59.594 --> 00:13:01.200
were called in to help.

00:13:01.200 --> 00:13:02.790
They were able to get the
approval of the Church

00:13:02.790 --> 00:13:04.970
to send a Priest to perform
an exorcism on David.

00:13:04.970 --> 00:13:06.738
On the night of July 18th, 1981,

00:13:06.738 --> 00:13:09.110
Father Gordon came to perform the exorcism

00:13:09.110 --> 00:13:10.490
with the assistance of Ed and Lorraine.

00:13:10.490 --> 00:13:11.720
Only in this case,

00:13:11.720 --> 00:13:13.800
the exorcism got way out of hand

00:13:13.800 --> 00:13:15.550
and was ultimately not successful,

00:13:15.550 --> 00:13:17.640
thanks in some part to the
visions that Lorraine had,

00:13:17.640 --> 00:13:18.640
connecting her to the tunnel

00:13:18.640 --> 00:13:20.420
where Isla was performing the ritual from.

00:13:20.420 --> 00:13:22.950
These visions seem to cause
physical pain to Lorraine,

00:13:22.950 --> 00:13:24.510
and ultimately, young David,

00:13:24.510 --> 00:13:26.800
whose demonic possession is
being channeled through Isla,

00:13:26.800 --> 00:13:28.240
breaks free and attacks Ed.

00:13:28.240 --> 00:13:29.670
In an effort out of desperation,

00:13:29.670 --> 00:13:31.800
the boyfriend of David's
sister, Arne Johnson,

00:13:31.800 --> 00:13:33.435
willingly offered his soul to the demon

00:13:33.435 --> 00:13:34.905
in an attempt to save David.

00:13:34.905 --> 00:13:37.946
- Leave him alone and take me!

00:13:37.946 --> 00:13:39.521
(growling)

00:13:46.690 --> 00:13:48.530
- Since Arne was connected to both David

00:13:48.530 --> 00:13:50.150
and his sister, Debbie Glatzel,

00:13:50.150 --> 00:13:51.860
taking control of him would grant access

00:13:51.860 --> 00:13:53.540
to both the child and the lover.

00:13:53.540 --> 00:13:55.060
Arne and his girlfriend are in love

00:13:55.060 --> 00:13:56.684
and constantly expressing
physical affection

00:13:56.684 --> 00:13:58.230
prior to Arne's possession.

00:13:58.230 --> 00:13:59.840
Because he willingly offered his soul,

00:13:59.840 --> 00:14:01.500
Isla wouldn't need to place a new totem

00:14:01.500 --> 00:14:02.570
in order to possess him.

00:14:02.570 --> 00:14:04.260
The evil goes dormant inside of him,

00:14:04.260 --> 00:14:06.440
so everyone lets their guard
down for the time being,

00:14:06.440 --> 00:14:08.694
believing that the exorcism was a success.

00:14:08.694 --> 00:14:10.550
However it would not be long before Arne

00:14:10.550 --> 00:14:12.310
would start to notice visions of Isla,

00:14:12.310 --> 00:14:14.130
who eventually takes full control of Arne

00:14:14.130 --> 00:14:16.310
and possesses him to
kill his landlord, Bruno.

00:14:16.310 --> 00:14:18.230
The Warrens figure out that
Arne is still possessed

00:14:18.230 --> 00:14:20.410
and try to provoke the
evil entity inside of him

00:14:20.410 --> 00:14:21.930
by setting up religious objects

00:14:21.930 --> 00:14:24.130
such as the cross, and
having him read from a Bible,

00:14:24.130 --> 00:14:26.630
which he, surprisingly,
does with no problem.

00:14:26.630 --> 00:14:28.860
However, the Warrens are
operating under the assumption

00:14:28.860 --> 00:14:30.770
that his possession would
follow the same rules

00:14:30.770 --> 00:14:32.870
as previous demonic
cases they had dealt with

00:14:32.870 --> 00:14:35.220
like Malthus, who would
be averse to holy objects.

00:14:35.220 --> 00:14:36.310
What they seem to overlook

00:14:36.310 --> 00:14:37.900
is that it's also not actually the demon

00:14:37.900 --> 00:14:39.340
that is directly taking possession of him.

00:14:39.340 --> 00:14:40.950
It's Isla herself.

00:14:40.950 --> 00:14:42.320
That makes this case more similar

00:14:42.320 --> 00:14:44.183
to The Enfield Poltergeist case in 1977,

00:14:44.183 --> 00:14:46.140
where a girl named Janet Hodgson

00:14:46.140 --> 00:14:47.820
was possessed by the nun-demon Valak,

00:14:47.820 --> 00:14:49.930
but Lorraine wasn't able to detect Valak

00:14:49.930 --> 00:14:51.770
because it was using
the ghost of an old man

00:14:51.770 --> 00:14:53.090
as a sort of intermediary.

00:14:53.090 --> 00:14:54.880
Isla also uses a
different tactic at times.

00:14:54.880 --> 00:14:56.640
When she takes possession of people,

00:14:56.640 --> 00:14:57.620
she'll give them visions

00:14:57.620 --> 00:14:59.430
of horrifying creatures threatening them.

00:14:59.430 --> 00:15:01.160
This leads the possessed person to react

00:15:01.160 --> 00:15:02.580
by attacking the people around them.

00:15:02.580 --> 00:15:04.720
Personally, I wonder why
she does this so often

00:15:04.720 --> 00:15:06.840
instead of just taking
direct control of her victim,

00:15:06.840 --> 00:15:07.860
like she did with David.

00:15:07.860 --> 00:15:09.640
This is one of those cases
where The Conjuring lore

00:15:09.640 --> 00:15:11.130
isn't really that clearly defined

00:15:11.130 --> 00:15:12.340
and we have to make our own assumptions.

00:15:12.340 --> 00:15:14.020
The best guess that I can come up with

00:15:14.020 --> 00:15:15.712
is that the rules of the
curse she's trying to perform

00:15:15.712 --> 00:15:18.203
require that her victims carry
out the actions themselves.

00:15:18.203 --> 00:15:20.850
So for example, when
she needs Jessica Strong

00:15:20.850 --> 00:15:23.230
to end herself, she can't
just take control of Jessica

00:15:23.230 --> 00:15:24.160
and run off the cliff.

00:15:24.160 --> 00:15:26.660
She has to scare her into
running off the cliff on her own.

00:15:26.660 --> 00:15:28.622
However, she does later
attempt to get rid of Arne

00:15:28.622 --> 00:15:30.479
by literally just taking control of him

00:15:30.479 --> 00:15:32.190
and having him slit his own wrists,

00:15:32.190 --> 00:15:34.020
but maybe that's not part of the curse.

00:15:34.020 --> 00:15:36.409
Maybe she was giving up on
Arne as a vessel at that point

00:15:36.409 --> 00:15:37.990
because she didn't like
Lorraine being able

00:15:37.990 --> 00:15:39.500
to see her through her victims.

00:15:39.500 --> 00:15:41.130
Otherwise, you would think
she would have just done that

00:15:41.130 --> 00:15:42.660
to all of her victims to begin with.

00:15:42.660 --> 00:15:44.394
Or maybe she just enjoys
tormenting her victims

00:15:44.394 --> 00:15:45.760
and seeing them react.

00:15:45.760 --> 00:15:48.300
That's the easier but
less fun explanation.

00:15:48.300 --> 00:15:50.630
As I alluded to, when
Isla initiated the curse,

00:15:50.630 --> 00:15:52.051
she didn't anticipate Warrens' involvement

00:15:52.051 --> 00:15:53.720
and their investigation throws

00:15:53.720 --> 00:15:55.200
a significant wrench into her plans.

00:15:55.200 --> 00:15:57.170
Ed and Lorraine investigate
at the funeral home

00:15:57.170 --> 00:15:59.260
that Jessica Strong is
resting at where Lorraine,

00:15:59.260 --> 00:16:00.840
due to her abilities, is able to see

00:16:00.840 --> 00:16:02.290
through Isla's point-of-view.

00:16:03.992 --> 00:16:06.400
- [Lorraine] Oh, she
has him. She has Arne.

00:16:08.003 --> 00:16:10.759
Oh, no, no.

00:16:10.759 --> 00:16:12.464
(tense music)

00:16:12.464 --> 00:16:13.962
Oh God.

00:16:13.962 --> 00:16:16.973
- [Isla] And this Black Sabbath.

00:16:16.973 --> 00:16:20.343
- By the blood of Calvary I command it!

00:16:20.343 --> 00:16:23.272
(tense music)
(Lorraine groaning)

00:16:23.272 --> 00:16:25.450
(thunder crashes)

00:16:25.450 --> 00:16:27.390
- Isla is surprised by
Lorraine's psychic visions,

00:16:27.390 --> 00:16:29.034
but doesn't seem to be too afraid of her.

00:16:29.034 --> 00:16:30.524
- How are you doing this?

00:16:30.524 --> 00:16:32.256
- God has shown you to me.

00:16:32.256 --> 00:16:34.386
- Then your God has damned you.

00:16:34.386 --> 00:16:36.360
- In addition to possessing living people,

00:16:36.360 --> 00:16:38.030
Isla can also possess corpses,

00:16:38.030 --> 00:16:39.370
temporarily giving them life.

00:16:39.370 --> 00:16:42.307
Because, apparently she can just do that.

00:16:42.307 --> 00:16:43.140
Good to know!

00:16:43.140 --> 00:16:44.760
As she discovers Lorraine watching her

00:16:44.760 --> 00:16:45.870
via the psychic connection,

00:16:45.870 --> 00:16:47.760
she takes control of a
big boy in the morgue,

00:16:47.760 --> 00:16:48.830
sending it to attack,

00:16:48.830 --> 00:16:50.650
and Ed is able to pull
Lorraine out of her vision

00:16:50.650 --> 00:16:51.483
just in time.

00:16:51.483 --> 00:16:53.200
If you're interested in
the mechanics of this,

00:16:53.200 --> 00:16:54.260
look at it like this.

00:16:54.260 --> 00:16:55.700
Lorraine was looking in on Isla

00:16:55.700 --> 00:16:57.769
by touching her previous victim, Jessica.

00:16:57.769 --> 00:16:59.090
Now that the connection is formed,

00:16:59.090 --> 00:17:00.600
Isla can look back at Lorraine,

00:17:00.600 --> 00:17:02.570
as long as Lorraine is
still touching Jessica.

00:17:02.570 --> 00:17:04.870
And Isla can control
other things in the room

00:17:04.870 --> 00:17:06.117
while the connection is still established.

00:17:06.117 --> 00:17:07.900
When Lorraine lets go of Jessica,

00:17:07.900 --> 00:17:09.450
the connection seems to be broken up

00:17:09.450 --> 00:17:11.913
and Isla loses control of
her big boy and he collapses.

00:17:11.913 --> 00:17:13.190
The cleaning crew in the morning

00:17:13.190 --> 00:17:14.620
is gonna be really confused.

00:17:14.620 --> 00:17:15.544
But Isla sees Ed,

00:17:15.544 --> 00:17:17.840
who is already vulnerable
due to his poor health,

00:17:17.840 --> 00:17:19.842
as a potential tool to
get rid of Lorraine.

00:17:19.842 --> 00:17:21.212
Not only would this leave Isla unopposed,

00:17:21.212 --> 00:17:23.930
but I imagine that Lorraine
could have checked off the box

00:17:23.930 --> 00:17:25.830
for the lover for her evil ritual,

00:17:25.830 --> 00:17:28.045
due to Lorraine's unwavering
love for her husband.

00:17:28.045 --> 00:17:29.760
She sends a new totem
to the Warrens' house,

00:17:29.760 --> 00:17:31.230
disguised as a bundle of flowers,

00:17:31.230 --> 00:17:33.710
and their assistant, Drew,
unknowingly brings it inside.

00:17:33.710 --> 00:17:35.307
It's not out of the
ordinary for the Warrens

00:17:35.307 --> 00:17:37.955
to receive gifts from families
they had helped in the past.

00:17:37.955 --> 00:17:39.530
This allows Isla to take control of Ed,

00:17:39.530 --> 00:17:41.870
who also gives her access to
see into the Warrens' house

00:17:41.870 --> 00:17:43.220
and view all their research.

00:17:43.220 --> 00:17:44.900
She seems to be taking a particular joy

00:17:44.900 --> 00:17:46.677
in possessing Ed by taunting him.

00:17:46.677 --> 00:17:49.354
- Oh don't worry, Mr. Warren.

00:17:49.354 --> 00:17:51.863
You're so close.

00:17:51.863 --> 00:17:53.792
I'd hate for you to give up now.

00:17:53.792 --> 00:17:55.790
(tense music)

00:17:55.790 --> 00:17:58.140
- Once again using the tactic
of encouraging her victims

00:17:58.140 --> 00:18:00.321
to do the dirty work by giving
them misleading visions,

00:18:00.321 --> 00:18:02.120
she gives Ed a vision
where he's being attacked

00:18:02.120 --> 00:18:04.166
by the bloated possessed
big boy from the morgue,

00:18:04.166 --> 00:18:06.264
causing him to grab a knife
and try to fight back.

00:18:06.264 --> 00:18:07.850
He is just barely stopped by Drew

00:18:07.850 --> 00:18:09.700
before actually stabbing his wife.

00:18:09.700 --> 00:18:12.130
Together they find the totem
and remove Isla's ability

00:18:12.130 --> 00:18:13.530
to access or control Ed.

00:18:13.530 --> 00:18:15.500
Isla knows that the Warrens
are closing in on her,

00:18:15.500 --> 00:18:17.010
and that they now know
how to stop the curse

00:18:17.010 --> 00:18:19.080
by destroying her altar,
if they can find it,

00:18:19.080 --> 00:18:20.920
so she must enact the
end of the curse fast

00:18:20.920 --> 00:18:22.030
if she wants to succeed.

00:18:22.030 --> 00:18:23.330
To make matters worse for her,

00:18:23.330 --> 00:18:25.050
Lorraine goes to Father Kastner for help

00:18:25.050 --> 00:18:26.290
translating the Stregheria,

00:18:26.290 --> 00:18:28.780
having no idea that she is so
close to Isla and her altar

00:18:28.780 --> 00:18:29.640
as she does so.

00:18:29.640 --> 00:18:32.220
Father Kastner also reveals
that Isla is his child

00:18:32.220 --> 00:18:33.930
and that he is aware of what she is up to,

00:18:33.930 --> 00:18:35.780
but he couldn't bring
himself to turn her in

00:18:35.780 --> 00:18:38.080
because she was his daughter
and he still loved her.

00:18:38.080 --> 00:18:39.682
I would assume that these
sentimental feelings

00:18:39.682 --> 00:18:41.460
are not mutual however,

00:18:41.460 --> 00:18:43.000
because as soon as Lorraine leaves,

00:18:43.000 --> 00:18:45.188
Isla pays her father a little visit.

00:18:45.188 --> 00:18:48.188
(logo thuds loudly)

00:18:49.693 --> 00:18:52.276
(creepy music)

00:18:54.293 --> 00:18:56.010
As Father Kastner prays for forgiveness

00:18:56.010 --> 00:18:58.760
for his failures as a
priest and as a father,

00:18:58.760 --> 00:19:01.707
he is cut short when Isla
coldly slashes throat,

00:19:01.707 --> 00:19:04.460
not even giving him the time
to utter his final words.

00:19:04.460 --> 00:19:06.360
This action, whether
she planned it or not,

00:19:06.360 --> 00:19:08.430
fulfills the man of God part of the curse,

00:19:08.430 --> 00:19:10.060
bringing her one step closer to winning.

00:19:10.060 --> 00:19:11.670
If she managed to kill Lorraine,

00:19:11.670 --> 00:19:13.030
no one would be there to stop her

00:19:13.030 --> 00:19:14.540
from killing a child to satisfy

00:19:14.540 --> 00:19:16.115
the last requirement of the curse.

00:19:16.115 --> 00:19:17.980
However, she also knows
she's in real trouble

00:19:17.980 --> 00:19:19.577
because if Lorraine
destroys her altar in time,

00:19:19.577 --> 00:19:21.400
the whole plan will be broken up.

00:19:21.400 --> 00:19:23.463
Luckily for Isla, she made
her altar out of stone

00:19:23.463 --> 00:19:25.630
and Lorraine can't move it on her own.

00:19:25.630 --> 00:19:27.080
She reaches and attacks Lorraine.

00:19:27.080 --> 00:19:29.350
Specifically, she tries to
stab Lorraine in the eye,

00:19:29.350 --> 00:19:31.200
both a literal and figurative attack

00:19:31.200 --> 00:19:32.400
on Lorraine's psychic visions

00:19:32.400 --> 00:19:34.620
that have been the cause
of concern for Isla so far.

00:19:34.620 --> 00:19:36.440
But it is Lorraine's psychic ability,

00:19:36.440 --> 00:19:37.880
once again, that saves her,

00:19:37.880 --> 00:19:39.450
because she's able to see herself

00:19:39.450 --> 00:19:40.540
through Isla' point of view,

00:19:40.540 --> 00:19:42.470
and it is only there
that she notices the rock

00:19:42.470 --> 00:19:44.900
that she uses to smash The
Occultist and break free.

00:19:44.900 --> 00:19:46.920
When Ed arrives to save
and protect Lorraine,

00:19:46.920 --> 00:19:49.395
Isla once again takes
possession of him by-

00:19:49.395 --> 00:19:51.690
(Isla exhales sharply)

00:19:51.690 --> 00:19:53.200
Blowing dust in his face?

00:19:53.200 --> 00:19:55.220
It seems like they're just
making rules up at this point,

00:19:55.220 --> 00:19:57.780
but I guess maybe that was
like a ground up witch's totem?

00:19:57.780 --> 00:19:59.330
Who knows at this point honestly?

00:19:59.330 --> 00:20:00.163
Let's just roll with it.

00:20:00.163 --> 00:20:01.710
When Isla takes possession of a person,

00:20:01.710 --> 00:20:03.390
she works the same way a demon does

00:20:03.390 --> 00:20:04.700
in that she can split her attention

00:20:04.700 --> 00:20:07.250
between the possessed
individual and her own self.

00:20:07.250 --> 00:20:08.760
We saw this in "Annabelle Creation"

00:20:08.760 --> 00:20:09.970
where the horned demon Malthus

00:20:09.970 --> 00:20:11.700
could terrorize people in one location,

00:20:11.700 --> 00:20:12.840
and the possessed Janice

00:20:12.840 --> 00:20:14.410
could come after people in another room.

00:20:14.410 --> 00:20:16.400
Isla uses this technique to her advantage

00:20:16.400 --> 00:20:18.160
by sending Ed after Lorraine with a mallet

00:20:18.160 --> 00:20:20.160
to distract from her
returning to the altar

00:20:20.160 --> 00:20:21.940
to take control of Arne one more time.

00:20:21.940 --> 00:20:23.670
She starts the ritual with Arne's photo.

00:20:23.670 --> 00:20:25.730
As he writhes in pain
under Isla's possession,

00:20:25.730 --> 00:20:27.330
she gets him to pick up a shard of glass

00:20:27.330 --> 00:20:28.650
and hold to his own throat.

00:20:28.650 --> 00:20:31.100
Luckily for Arne, his
girlfriend holds his arm back,

00:20:31.100 --> 00:20:32.520
while a Priest goes into some prayers

00:20:32.520 --> 00:20:34.020
to try to rid him of his possession.

00:20:34.020 --> 00:20:35.700
Meanwhile, as Ed attacks Lorraine,

00:20:35.700 --> 00:20:38.240
she pleads with him to
remember their first kiss.

00:20:38.240 --> 00:20:40.443
- She tried to turn you against me

00:20:40.443 --> 00:20:45.443
because she thinks our love
is our weakness, but it's not.

00:20:45.691 --> 00:20:47.590
- These words get through to him,

00:20:47.590 --> 00:20:49.370
and he's able to regain control of himself

00:20:49.370 --> 00:20:51.750
and smash Isla's altar carnival style,

00:20:51.750 --> 00:20:54.628
breaking the curse and releasing
Arne from Isla's control.

00:20:54.628 --> 00:20:56.370
- Your curse is broken.

00:20:56.370 --> 00:20:57.660
- In the end, Lorraine's ability

00:20:57.660 --> 00:20:59.100
to get through to Ed was fitting.

00:20:59.100 --> 00:21:01.740
It was supposedly their love
that helped them defeat Isla,

00:21:01.740 --> 00:21:03.210
and she was not able to stop them

00:21:03.210 --> 00:21:04.610
because she didn't know love.

00:21:04.610 --> 00:21:06.370
As the illegitimate daughter of a priest,

00:21:06.370 --> 00:21:07.430
she lived an isolated life

00:21:07.430 --> 00:21:09.960
where her only family
looked upon her in shame.

00:21:09.960 --> 00:21:11.710
Although her father may
have cared about her,

00:21:11.710 --> 00:21:13.420
she was blinded by resentment.

00:21:13.420 --> 00:21:16.450
The malnourished lady was
also malnourished from love.

00:21:16.450 --> 00:21:17.800
But even with her master plan

00:21:17.800 --> 00:21:19.370
literally having crumbled before her,

00:21:19.370 --> 00:21:21.700
Isla emerges from the
dark with a knife in hand,

00:21:21.700 --> 00:21:23.415
looking like she's going
to use it to take revenge

00:21:23.415 --> 00:21:26.400
on the paranormal couple that
had ruined everything for her.

00:21:26.400 --> 00:21:27.900
Before getting the chance to do this,

00:21:27.900 --> 00:21:29.870
the demon she had summoned finally arrives

00:21:29.870 --> 00:21:31.050
in a corporeal form.

00:21:31.050 --> 00:21:32.870
It is not clear who this demon this is.

00:21:32.870 --> 00:21:34.904
We only see it in the
form of the Isla herself.

00:21:34.904 --> 00:21:37.272
To me, this suggests that
the identity of the demon

00:21:37.272 --> 00:21:40.080
doesn't really matter
because Isla is the true evil

00:21:40.080 --> 00:21:42.271
of this story that had possessed
each of the victims so far.

00:21:42.271 --> 00:21:44.210
Unlike the previous "Conjuring" movies

00:21:44.210 --> 00:21:45.877
which draw from the lore
of the old grimoire,

00:21:45.877 --> 00:21:47.170
"The Lesser Key of Solomon,"

00:21:47.170 --> 00:21:49.290
which appears as a book
called "The Devil's Welcome"

00:21:49.290 --> 00:21:50.390
in the first Annabelle movie,

00:21:50.390 --> 00:21:52.120
the dark magic conjured by Isla

00:21:52.120 --> 00:21:54.508
was inspired by the Italian
concept of Stregheria,

00:21:54.508 --> 00:21:56.516
which is just an archaic
word for witchcraft.

00:21:56.516 --> 00:21:59.647
There isn't a specific roster
of demons associated with it.

00:21:59.647 --> 00:22:01.920
So the Warrens see this
demon in the form of Isla

00:22:01.920 --> 00:22:03.290
as it twists and contorts her,

00:22:03.290 --> 00:22:06.171
before finishing her with this.

00:22:06.171 --> 00:22:08.671
(tense music)

00:22:13.731 --> 00:22:14.723
(demon roars)

00:22:14.723 --> 00:22:17.390
(head squishes)

00:22:18.580 --> 00:22:20.720
Ed explains that she
promised this demon a soul

00:22:20.720 --> 00:22:22.670
and it would not go back
to hell without one.

00:22:22.670 --> 00:22:24.060
And that concludes today's lesson

00:22:24.060 --> 00:22:25.180
on The Occultist, Isla.

00:22:25.180 --> 00:22:26.887
The malnourished lady.

00:22:26.887 --> 00:22:28.459
Click the playlist on
the left for my analysis

00:22:28.459 --> 00:22:31.160
of other evil entities in
the Conjuring universe,

00:22:31.160 --> 00:22:33.340
like Bathsheba, Malthus and Valak.

00:22:33.340 --> 00:22:35.104
And remember to subscribe to CZsWorld

00:22:35.104 --> 00:22:36.890
for new horrors every week,

00:22:36.890 --> 00:22:39.230
ring the deathbell and
select all notifications

00:22:39.230 --> 00:22:41.240
and I will see you in the next one.

00:22:41.240 --> 00:22:43.571
Assuming we both survive.

00:22:43.571 --> 00:22:46.654
(gentle piano music)

